    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it's just not a \"sign\" of anything, it's just my reality. i've tried the therapy stuff and the \"social skills\" stuff and nothing changes. it's like being a different species. no matter how hard i try, the gap just stays there. it's just... so much work for nothing. what's the point of trying to bridge a gap that isn't even meant to be bridged?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
